"03:08.954">itsumade</span><span begin="03:08.954" end="03:09.688">mo</span><span begin="03:09.915" end="03:11.339">nantenain</span><span begin="03:11.339" end="03:11.754">da</span></text><text for="L50"><span begin="03:11.888" end="03:12.894">owariyu</span><span begin="03:12.894" end="03:13.827">ku</span><span begin="03:13.937" end="03:14.912">sonomae</span><span begin="03:14.912" end="03:16.107">ni</span></text><text for="L51"><span begin="03:16.107" end="03:16.866">i'ppo</span><span begin="03:16.866" end="03:17.815">fumidashi</span><span begin="03:17.815" end="03:18.313">te</span><span begin="03:18.313" end="03:18.825">mi</span><span begin="03:18.825" end="03:19.505">ta</span></text><text for="L52"><span begin="03:19.773" end="03:20.760">ukeire</span><span begin="03:20.760" end="03:21.294">na</span><span begin="03:21.294" end="03:21.735">ga</span><span begin="03:21.735" end="03:22.291">ra</span></text><text for="L53"><span begin="03:22.291" end="03:23.741">inori</span><span begin="03:23.741" end="03:24.737">naga</span><span begin="03:24.737" end="03:27.123">ra</span></text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:51.067"><div begin="00:07.026" end="03:27.123"><p begin="00:07.026" end="00:10.342" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:07.026" end="00:07.953">描いた</span><span begin="00:07.953" end="00:08.783">地図は</span><span begin="00:08.979" end="00:09.419">引き</span><span begin="00:09.419" end="00:09.880">裂い</span><span begin="00:09.880" end="00:10.342">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">昔日描绘的地图已破旧不堪</span></p><p begin="00:10.895" end="00:14.325" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:10.895" end="00:11.928">世界は</span><span begin="00:11.928" end="00:12.436">あの</span><span begin="00:12.436" end="00:12.886">日</span><span begin="00:12.886" end="00:13.340">の</span><span begin="00:13.340" end="00:13.907">ま</span><span begin="00:13.907" end="00:14.325">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世界却仍是一如那日的模样</span></p><p begin="00:14.916" end="00:17.231" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:14.916" end="00:15.790">僕はま</span><span begin="00:15.790" end="00:17.231">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我又再一次地</span></p><p begin="00:17.267" end="00:21.132" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:17.267" end="00:17.805">誰</span><span begin="00:17.805" end="00:18.555">か</span><span begin="00:18.555" end="00:18.731">の</span><span begin="00:18.731" end="00:19.565">せいに</span><span begin="00:19.565" end="00:19.795">し</span><span begin="00:19.795" end="00:21.132">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把所有错误归咎于他人</span></p><p begin="00:21.817" end="00:23.484" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:21.817" end="00:22.159">嫌に</span><span begin="00:22.159" end="00:22.605">なっ</span><span begin="00:22.605" end="00:23.212">ちゃう</span><span begin="00:23.212" end="00:23.484">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也好讨厌这样的自己</span></p><p begin="00:24.727" end="00:32.189" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:24.727" end="00:24.995">こ</span><span begin="00:24.995" end="00:25.459">の</span><span begin="00:25.459" end="00:25.694">ま</span><span begin="00:25.694" end="00:26.245">ま</span><span begin="00:26.728" end="00:27.407">何</span><span begin="00:27.407" end="00:27.703">か</span><span begin="00:27.703" end="00:28.128">を</span><span begin="00:28.128" end="00:28.549">待ち</span><span begin="00:28.549" end="00:29.341">続</span><span begin="00:29.341" end="00:29.572">け</span><span begin="00:29.572" end="00:30.344">る</span><span begin="00:30.595" end="00:31.511">フリする</span><span begin="00:31.511" end="00:32.189">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还要继续这样</span></p><p begin="00:32.572" end="00:38.689" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:32.572" end="00:32.822">こ</span><span begin="00:32.822" end="00:33.327">こ</span><span begin="00:33.327" end="00:33.620">か</span><span begin="00:33.620" end="00:34.135">ら</span><span begin="00:34.135" end="00:34.588">僕</span><span begin="00:34.588" end="00:35.245">は</span><span begin="00:35.508" end="00:36.465">やりなお</span><span begin="00:36.465" end="00:37.006">せ</span><span begin="00:37.006" end="00:37.529">ます</span><span begin="00:37.529" end="00:38.689">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还能从这里重新开始吗</span></p><p begin="00:40.440" end="00:44.107" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:40.440" end="00:41.427">どこまで</span><span begin="00:41.427" end="00:42.393">も</span><span begin="00:42.393" end="00:43.479">行ける気</span><span begin="00:43.479" end="00:43.717">が</span><span begin="00:43.717" end="00:43.918">し</span><span begin="00:43.918" end="00:44.107">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾以为自己世界之大无所不往</span></p><p begin="00:44.389" end="00:48.256" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:44.389" end="00:44.941">あの</span><span begin="00:44.941" end="00:45.388">時</span><span begin="00:45.388" end="00:46.177">の</span><span begin="00:46.404" end="00:47.080">僕は</span><span begin="00:47.080" end="00:47.342">ど</span><span begin="00:47.342" end="00:47.765">こ</span><span begin="00:47.765" end="00:48.256">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那个时候的我到底去了哪里呢</span></p><p begin="00:48.357" end="00:52.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:48.357" end="00:48.726">きっ</span><span begin="00:48.726" end="00:49.228">と</span><span begin="00:49.245" end="00:50.289">大人に</span><span begin="00:50.289" end="00:50.711">なっ</span><span begin="00:50.711" end="00:51.357">たと</span><span begin="00:51.357" end="00:52.040">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定早就已经长大成人了吧</span></p><p begin="00:52.457" end="00:55.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:52.457" end="00:53.479">そういう</span><span begin="00:53.479" end="00:54.628">ことじゃなく</span><span begin="00:54.628" end="00:55.116">て</span><span begin="00:55.116" end="00:55.840">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而我却始终无法如此认为</span></p><p begin="00:56.173" end="01:00.040" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:56.173" end="00:57.108">あと少</span><span begin="00:57.108" end="00:57.944">し</span><span begin="00:58.162" end="00:58.828">だけの</span><span begin="00:58.828" end="00:59.484">勇</span><span begin="00:59.484" end="00:59.640">気</span><span begin="00:59.640" end="01:00.040">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明只需要一点点的勇气</span></p><p begin="01:00.139" end="01:03.957" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:00.139" end="01:01.094">変えられ</span><span begin="01:01.094" end="01:02.024">た</span><span begin="01:02.125" end="01:03.483">明日はあっ</span><span begin="01:03.483" end="01:03.957">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就可以改变我们的明天了</span></p><p begin="01:04.056" end="01:07.739" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:04.056" end="01:04.977">それさえ</span><span begin="01:04.977" end="01:06.483">気づけなかっ</span><span begin="01:06.483" end="01:06.978">たん</span><span begin="01:06.978" end="01:07.739">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我却连这一点都未能察觉</span></p><p begin="01:08.207" end="01:14.739" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:08.207" end="01:08.933">そんな</span><span begin="01:08.933" end="01:09.952">瞬間</span><span begin="01:09.952" end="01:10.441">は</span><span begin="01:10.441" end="01:10.921">何</span><span begin="01:10.921" end="01:11.458">度</span><span begin="01:11.458" end="01:11.939">あっ</span><span begin="01:11.939" end="01:12.444">たん</span><span begin="01:12.444" end="01:12.948">だ</span><span begin="01:12.948" end="01:13.097">ろ</span><span begin="01:13.097" end="01:14.739">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知已迎来多少次这样的瞬间</span></p><p begin="01:15.848" end="01:19.496" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:15.848" end="01:16.831">結んだ</span><span begin="01:16.831" end="01:17.304">糸</span><span begin="01:17.304" end="01:17.826">は</span><span begin="01:17.850" end="01:18.617">解</span><span begin="01:18.617" end="01:18.766">い</span><span begin="01:18.766" end="01:19.496">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连结在一起的丝线已经松开</span></p><p begin="01:19.754" end="01:23.348" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:19.754" end="01:20.766">世界は</span><span begin="01:20.766" end="01:21.247">あの</span><span begin="01:21.247" end="01:21.808">日</span><span begin="01:21.808" end="01:22.181">の</span><span begin="01:22.181" end="01:22.783">ま</span><span begin="01:22.783" end="01:23.348">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世界却仍是一如那日的模样</span></p><p begin="01:23.719" end="01:26.034" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:23.719" end="01:24.613">僕はま</span><span begin="01:24.613" end="01:26.034">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我又再一次地</span></p><p begin="01:26.203" end="01:29.637" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:26.203" end="01:26.715">繰り</span><span begin="01:26.715" end="01:27.348">返</span><span begin="01:27.348" end="01:27.622">して</span><span begin="01:27.622" end="01:28.492">ば</span><span begin="01:28.492" end="01:28.683">か</span><span begin="01:28.683" end="01:29.637">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">重蹈覆辙</span></p><p begin="01:30.637" end="01:32.304" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:30.637" end="01:31.114">嫌に</span><span begin="01:31.114" end="01:31.519">なっ</span><span begin="01:31.519" end="01:32.008">ちゃう</span><span begin="01:32.008" end="01:32.304">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也好讨厌这样的自己</span></p><p begin="01:32.603" end="01:37.453" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:32.603" end="01:32.812">身</span><span begin="01:32.812" end="01:33.772">勝手な</span><span begin="01:33.772" end="01:34.647">夢を</span><span begin="01:34.647" end="01:35.234">抱い</span><span begin="01:35.234" end="01:35.682">て</span><span begin="01:35.682" end="01:37.195">自ら砕い</span><span begin="01:37.195" end="01:37.453">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">擅自怀抱着自私的梦想 却又自己粉碎了梦想</span></p><p begin="01:37.553" end="01:39.988" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:37.553" end="01:38.507">何がし</span><span begin="01:38.507" end="01:39.401">た</span><span begin="01:39.401" end="01:39.501">い</span><span begin="01:39.501" end="01:39.988">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也搞不清自己的想法了</span></p><p begin="01:39.988" end="01:47.335" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:39.988" end="01:40.526">いつ</span><span begin="01:40.526" end="01:41.046">か</span><span begin="01:41.149" end="01:42.197">この闇</span><span begin="01:42.197" end="01:43.000">を</span><span begin="01:43.000" end="01:43.992">切り裂</span><span begin="01:43.992" end="01:44.368">い</span><span begin="01:44.368" end="01:45.381">て</span><span begin="01:45.381" end="01:45.481">く</span><span begin="01:45.481" end="01:46.176">れ</span><span begin="01:46.176" end="01:46.446">な</span><span begin="01:46.446" end="01:46.957">い</span><span begin="01:46.957" end="01:47.335">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有朝一日</span></p><p begin="01:47.335" end="01:49.183" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:47.335" end="01:47.884">Oh</span> <span begin="01:47.884" end="01:48.361">My</span> <span begin="01:48.361" end="01:49.183">Life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的人生啊</span></p><p begin="01:49.301" end="01:52.950" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:49.301" end="01:50.263">僕たち</span><span begin="01:50.263" end="01:51.241">の</span><span begin="01:51.241" end="01:52.265">正義は</span><span begin="01:52.265" end="01:52.671">きっ</span><span begin="01:52.671" end="01:52.950">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们所坚持的正义</span></p><p begin="01:53.167" end="01:57.083" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:53.167" end="01:54.210">誰かに</span><span begin="01:54.210" end="01:54.987">は</span><span begin="01:55.169" end="01:56.134">邪魔なも</span><span begin="01:56.134" end="01:56.645">の</span><span begin="01:56.645" end="01:57.083">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定是他人眼中的阻碍</span></p><p begin="01:57.135" end="02:00.801" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:57.135" end="01:57.624">きっ</span><span begin="01:57.624" end="01:58.172">と</span><span begin="01:58.172" end="01:59.584">仕方なかっ</span><span begin="01:59.584" end="02:00.206">たと</span><span begin="02:00.206" end="02:00.801">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对此我们一定都无能为力吧</span></p><p begin="02:01.317" end="02:04.702" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:01.317" end="02:02.268">そういう</span><span begin="02:02.268" end="02:03.597">ことじゃなく</span><span begin="02:03.597" end="02:03.981">て</span><span begin="02:03.981" end="02:04.702">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而我却始终无法如此认为</span></p><p begin="02:05.067" end="02:08.683" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:05.067" end="02:06.004">あと少</span><span begin="02:06.004" end="02:06.900">し</span><span begin="02:06.900" end="02:07.906">強くな</span><span begin="02:07.906" end="02:08.466">れ</span><span begin="02:08.466" end="02:08.683">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明只要再变强一点点</span></p><p begin="02:09.001" end="02:12.835" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:09.001" end="02:09.960">守られ</span><span begin="02:09.960" end="02:10.755">る</span><span begin="02:10.957" end="02:12.353">明日があっ</span><span begin="02:12.353" end="02:12.835">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就可以守护我们的明天了</span></p><p begin="02:12.869" end="02:16.467" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:12.869" end="02:13.381">全</span><span begin="02:13.381" end="02:13.908">て</span><span begin="02:13.908" end="02:14.541">変わっ</span><span begin="02:14.541" end="02:14.856">た</span><span begin="02:14.856" end="02:15.794">夜</span><span begin="02:15.794" end="02:16.467">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便在一切幡然巨变的夜里</span></p><p begin="02:16.850" end="02:19.345" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:16.850" end="02:17.853">またここ</span><span begin="02:17.853" end="02:18.336">か</span><span begin="02:18.336" end="02:18.782">ら</span><span begin="02:18.782" end="02:19.345">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也能够笑言一句 我们还能从这里重新开始</span></p><p begin="02:19.345" end="02:23.028" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:19.345" end="02:20.770">笑え</span><span begin="02:20.770" end="02:21.747">たら</span><span begin="02:21.747" end="02:23.028">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然后笑着面对多好啊</span></p><p begin="02:23.028" end="02:25.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:23.028" end="02:23.745">捻く</span><span begin="02:23.745" end="02:24.241">れ</span><span begin="02:24.241" end="02:24.779">た</span><span begin="02:24.779" end="02:25.182">感</span><span begin="02:25.182" end="02:25.720">情</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我那固执而扭曲的感情</span></p><p begin="02:25.720" end="02:28.371" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="02:25.720" end="02:25.932">出</span><span begin="02:25.932" end="02:26.493">て</span><span begin="02:26.493" end="02:26.724">こ</span><span begin="02:26.724" end="02:27.246">ない</span><span begin="02:27.246" end="02:27.691">で</span><span begin="02:27.691" end="02:28.371">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要出现在我的眼前</span></p><p begin="02:28.371" end="02:32.305" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="02:28.371" end="02:28.862">きっ</span><span begin="02:28.862" end="02:30.349">と変われたん</span><span begin="02:30.349" end="02:31.260">だ</span><span begin="02:31.260" end="02:31.495">も</span><span begin="02:31.495" end="02:32.305">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一定早就已经改变了</span></p><p begin="02:33.060" end="02:36.283" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="02:33.060" end="02:33.527">君</span><span begin="02:33.527" end="02:34.236">に</span><span begin="02:34.236" end="02:34.593">サ</span><span begin="02:34.593" end="02:35.041">ヨ</span><span begin="02:35.041" end="02:35.522">ナ</span><span begin="02:35.522" end="02:36.283">ラ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此和你道别</span></p><p begin="02:36.283" end="02:39.232" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="02:36.283" end="02:37.790">僕は君に</span><span begin="02:37.790" end="02:38.279">とっ</span><span begin="02:38.279" end="02:39.232">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾希望自己</span></p><p begin="02:38.720" end="02:40.720" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="02:38.720" end="02:39.696">誰かに</span><span begin="02:39.696" end="02:40.174">とっ</span><span begin="02:40.174" end="02:40.720">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可以成为对你而言</span></p><p begin="02:40.720" end="02:42.971" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="02:40.720" end="02:42.161">明けない夜</span><span begin="02:42.161" end="02:42.971">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对他人而言</span></p><p begin="02:42.677" end="02:44.581" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="02:42.677" end="02:44.138">消えない星</span><span begin="02:44.138" end="02:44.581">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永不消逝的星辰</span></p><p begin="02:44.464" end="02:46.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="02:44.464" end="02:44.950">なり</span><span begin="02:44.950" end="02:45.388">た</span><span begin="02:45.388" end="02:45.799">かっ</span><span begin="02:45.799" end="02:46.230">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">昏暗永夜之中永恒不灭的星辰</span></p><p begin="02:46.384" end="02:48.168" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="02:46.384" end="02:46.786">なれ</span><span begin="02:46.786" end="02:47.304">な</span><span begin="02:47.304" end="02:47.761">かっ</span><span begin="02:47.761" end="02:48.168">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最终我还是没能做到</span></p><p begin="02:48.301" end="02:52.600" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="02:48.301" end="02:48.797">僕</span><span begin="02:48.797" end="02:49.243">ら</span><span begin="02:49.243" end="02:50.062">は</span><span begin="02:50.062" end="02:50.329">こ</span><span begin="02:50.329" end="02:50.863">の</span><span begin="02:50.863" end="02:51.309">ま</span><span begin="02:51.309" end="02:52.600">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们就这样迎来分别</span></p><p begin="02:52.320" end="02:56.187" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45"><span begin="02:52.320" end="02:53.222">あと少</span><span begin="02:53.222" end="02:53.951">し</span><span begin="02:54.214" end="02:54.975">だけの</span><span begin="02:54.975" end="02:55.514">勇</span><span begin="02:55.514" end="02:55.731">気</span><span begin="02:55.731" end="02:56.187">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明只需要一点点的勇气</span></p><p begin="02:56.138" end="02:59.938" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46"><span begin="02:56.138" end="02:57.165">変えられ</span><span begin="02:57.165" end="02:57.906">た</span><span begin="02:58.126" end="02:59.543">明日はあっ</span><span begin="02:59.543" end="02:59.938">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就可以改变我们的明天了</span></p><p begin="03:00.088" end="03:03.888" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47"><span begin="03:00.088" end="03:01.098">それさえ</span><span begin="03:01.098" end="03:02.531">気づけなかっ</span><span begin="03:02.531" end="03:03.031">たん</span><span begin="03:03.031" end="03:03.888">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我却连这一点都未能察觉</span></p><p begin="03:04.270" end="03:07.637" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48"><span begin="03:04.270" end="03:05.971">そんな日はもう</span><span begin="03:05.971" end="03:06.919">たくさん</span><span begin="03:06.919" end="03:07.637">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经厌倦了这样的日子</span></p><p begin="03:08.021" end="03:11.754" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L49"><span begin="03:08.021" end="03:08.954">いつまで</span><span begin="03:08.954" end="03:09.688">も</span><span begin="03:09.915" end="03:11.339">なんてないん</span><span begin="03:11.339" end="03:11.754">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所谓的永远根本就不存在</span></p><p begin="03:11.888" end="03:16.107" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L50"><span begin="03:11.888" end="03:12.894">終わりゆ</span><span begin="03:12.894" end="03:13.827">く</span><span begin="03:13.937" end="03:14.912">その前</span><span begin="03:14.912" end="03:16.107">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以在一切走向终结之前</span></p><p begin="03:16.107" end="03:19.505" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L51"><span begin="03:16.107" end="03:16.866">一歩</span><span begin="03:16.866" end="03:17.815">踏み出し</span><span begin="03:17.815" end="03:18.313">て</span><span begin="03:18.313" end="03:18.825">み</span><span begin="03:18.825" end="03:19.505">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会试着向前踏出那一步</span></p><p begin="03:19.773" end="03:22.291" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L52"><span begin="03:19.773" end="03:20.760">受け入れ</span><span begin="03:20.760" end="03:21.294">な</span><span begin="03:21.294" end="03:21.735">が</span><span begin="03:21.735" end="03:22.291">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接受命运的安排</span></p><p begin="03:22.291" end="03:27.123" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L53"><span begin="03:22.291" end="03:23.741">祈り</span><span begin="03:23.741" end="03:24.737">なが</span><span begin="03:24.737" end="03:27.123">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀抱虔诚的祈祷</span></p></div></body></tt>